---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const asOf = '31 October 2026';
---

<Base title="Now" description="What Semih Buğra Sezer is working on and investigating right now.">
  <header class="wrap page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
    <h1>What I’m working on</h1>
    <p class="lede">A snapshot, not a promise. Updated <time datetime="2026-10-31">{asOf}</time>; statuses come from each project’s repository on that date.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap prose-wrap prose" style="padding-top:var(--s-6)">
    <h2>Active</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="/projects/seerxo-os/">Seerxo OS</a></strong> — V1, in active development. Working toward an
        evidence-backed unattended pilot of the isolated code-change stage, and a signed cutover of release duties
        to the public repository.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="/projects/sigsieve/">SigSieve</a></strong> — experimental pre-release
        (<code>v0.1.0-alpha.2</code>). Next: tagging <code>alpha.3</code>, broader hardware-key testing and an
        external review before anything non-experimental.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="/projects/seerxo/">Seerxo</a></strong> — live product. Keeping the open-source client’s
        dependency scanning green and extending the deterministic listing audit.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Investigating</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>What evidence is sufficient before an AI coding agent runs unattended.</li>
      <li>Destination-bound SSH authentication with non-exportable keys.</li>
      <li>Tool schemas that make agents report results without overclaiming.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Not active</h2>
    <p>
      The <a href="/projects/bridge/">Bridge</a> gateway and the <a href="/projects/self-hosted-devops/">self-hosted DevOps platform</a>
      have had no commits since July 2026 and May 2026 respectively.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
